# Cloudflare Pages - antete de raspuns
# Aliniat cu TekiDeki, Games si quiz.freehtml.dev (31.10.2026): HSTS, nosniff, Referrer-Policy.
#
# CSP: politicile de aici nu incarca nimic din afara domeniului (verificat: nici un <img>,
# <iframe>, <script> sau url() extern), deci aceeasi politica ca pe quiz merge fara schimbari.
#   worker-src 'self' blob: si connect-src 'self' sunt cerute de tests/test_pwa.py - fara ele
#   service workerul (offline) nu se mai instaleaza.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; media-src 'self' blob: data:; connect-src 'self'; worker-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests
